{"video":"gpHoIoo9Ddg","lines":[{"t":[0,3.4],"en":"Ho, ho, ho! Merry Christmas, boys and girls!"},{"t":[3.9,6.2],"en":"It's me, Santa Claus!"},{"t":[6.4,6.9],"en":"Hey, Santa!"},{"t":[7.9,9.1],"en":"They finally let you do it."},{"t":[9.7,10.5],"en":"Congrats, Phil."},{"t":[10.6,11.6],"en":"It's so edgy."},{"t":[11.9,13.7],"en":"I've been wanting to be Santa for years."},{"t":[14.1,18],"en":"I believe I have the right temperament and the figure to do the job well."},{"t":[18.1,20.7],"en":"So, Santa, what can we expect from this party?"},{"t":[21,23.7],"en":"It's going to be a very jolly time if you've been good."},{"t":[24.1,25.2],"en":"What if you've been bad?"},{"t":[25.5,27.4],"en":"Oh, then nothing but a lump of coal for you."},{"t":[27.4,31.6],"en":"What if you've been really, really bad, more evil than strictly wrong?"},{"t":[31.7,32],"en":"Hey, Creed?"},{"t":[32.5,33.6],"en":"We covered it. Lump of coal."},{"t":[34.3,34.5],"en":"Yeah."},{"t":[35.7,36.7],"en":"Here's Santa!"},{"t":[37.4,40.5],"en":"Hey, little girl, what would you like for Christmas?"},{"t":[41,44.1],"en":"Ooh, you have been a very naughty girl, I see."},{"t":[44.9,46.9],"en":"Michael, we already have a Santa, Phyllis."},{"t":[47.3,48.6],"en":"What the hell is going on?"},{"t":[50.9,52.9],"en":"Phyllis, Jim, Phyllis is Santa."},{"t":[53.5,53.7],"en":"Yeah."},{"t":[54,54.4],"en":"Phyllis."},{"t":[54.4,56.1],"en":"Yeah, I told her a long time ago she could do it."},{"t":[56.2,57.4],"en":"Take it back, that is absurd."},{"t":[57.5,58.4],"en":"No, I'm not going to do that."},{"t":[58.6,60],"en":"No, Jim, come on!"},{"t":[60,61],"en":"I think she'll do a good job."},{"t":[61.3,62.3],"en":"It's insane!"},{"t":[62.5,64],"en":"A woman's Santa, where does it stop?"},{"t":[64.1,64.5],"en":"No!"},{"t":[64.9,67.6],"en":"Jim, this may be the last Christmas that we have here."},{"t":[67.8,72.1],"en":"Doesn't it make you a tiny bit anxious, me not playing Santa?"},{"t":[72.3,72.9],"en":"Come on!"},{"t":[73.8,75.6],"en":"I'm not going to go tell Phyllis that she can't be Santa."},{"t":[75.9,77.5],"en":"Fine, then do it anonymously."},{"t":[78.1,79],"en":"Ransom note style."},{"t":[79.1,79.4],"en":"You can..."},{"t":[80.4,80.9],"en":"You know what?"},{"t":[80.9,83.6],"en":"I have a bunch of letters cut out of magazines in my desk."},{"t":[83.6,84.4],"en":"You can use those."},{"t":[84.8,85.8],"en":"Hello, little boy!"},{"t":[85.9,86.9],"en":"What's your name?"},{"t":[87.1,88.4],"en":"Michael, it's me, Kevin."},{"t":[89.6,91.4],"en":"Phyllis says I'm too big for her lap."},{"t":[91.6,97.4],"en":"Oh, I am so sorry that Phyllis hates you and hates your body."},{"t":[97.9,103.6],"en":"But Santa remembers a reindeer that was just a tiny bit different as well."},{"t":[103.7,105.3],"en":"When can I sit on your lap?"},{"t":[105.3,106],"en":"Right now!"},{"t":[106.1,107.8],"en":"Come on over here, big boy!"},{"t":[109.1,110.2],"en":"There we go!"},{"t":[110.4,111.3],"en":"Oh, my God!"},{"t":[112.8,114.1],"en":"That's really comfortable."},{"t":[116.7,118.8],"en":"What would you like for Christmas, little boy?"},{"t":[122,123],"en":"I don't know."},{"t":[123.4,125.5],"en":"I didn't know you were going to ask me that."},{"t":[125.9,127.7],"en":"What did you think was going to happen?"},{"t":[128.6,129.1],"en":"Well..."},{"t":[129.1,130.1],"en":"I'm trying, Phyllis."},{"t":[130.1,130.8],"en":"You're Santa."},{"t":[131,131.8],"en":"The only Santa."},{"t":[132.1,132.8],"en":"That's what I want."},{"t":[133,134],"en":"You promised me this."},{"t":[134.3,136.4],"en":"Don't make me get Bob involved."},{"t":[136.8,137.6],"en":"What would Bob do?"},{"t":[138.1,138.6],"en":"Never mind."},{"t":[138.7,139.7],"en":"I shouldn't have said that."},{"t":[141.3,142],"en":"Ryan, come here."},{"t":[142,142.4],"en":"Whoa, whoa, whoa."},{"t":[143,143.3],"en":"Come here!"},{"t":[143.4,144],"en":"I'm doing something."},{"t":[144,144.3],"en":"Come on!"},{"t":[145.1,145.2],"en":"Ah!"},{"t":[146.2,147],"en":"Ho, ho, ho!"},{"t":[147,148],"en":"Come on, I need this."},{"t":[148,148.7],"en":"Come over here."},{"t":[148.7,149.1],"en":"What are you talking?"},{"t":[149.2,149.9],"en":"Just sit down."},{"t":[150,150.2],"en":"I need this a bit."},{"t":[150.2,151.3],"en":"No, no, no, no, no, no, no, no, no, no."},{"t":[151.5,152],"en":"Is everything okay?"},{"t":[152.1,152.3],"en":"Yep."},{"t":[152.6,152.8],"en":"Yeah."},{"t":[153,154.2],"en":"Ryan, did I just have some fun?"},{"t":[154.3,155.3],"en":"Can I just talk to you for a second?"},{"t":[155.6,155.8],"en":"No, no."},{"t":[156.2,156.7],"en":"Okay, what?"},{"t":[157.5,161.8],"en":"You can't yell out, I need this, I need this, as you pin down an employee on your lap."},{"t":[161.9,163.6],"en":"Okay, you know what, Jim?"},{"t":[163.9,166.9],"en":"When there are two Santas in the room, things get ruthless."},{"t":[167.2,167.3],"en":"Yeah."},{"t":[167.4,167.9],"en":"Do you understand?"},{"t":[168,168.8],"en":"You forced my hand."},{"t":[168.9,169.6],"en":"Michael, it's Phyllis."},{"t":[169.7,170.6],"en":"We want Phyllis as Santa."},{"t":[170.8,171.3],"en":"Oh, do we?"},{"t":[171.6,172.1],"en":"Do we?"},{"t":[172.3,173.5],"en":"Is that what we want?"},{"t":[173.6,173.7],"en":"Yeah."},{"t":[173.7,175],"en":"Why don't we take a vote on it?"},{"t":[175,175.2],"en":"Great."},{"t":[175.6,178.9],"en":"Hey, okay, everybody, the office is being pulled apart."},{"t":[179.2,180.2],"en":"I realize that."},{"t":[180.6,182.9],"en":"There are traditions at stake."},{"t":[183.7,185.3],"en":"Who wants Phyllis as Santa?"},{"t":[185.3,186.6],"en":"No, no, no, wait, no."},{"t":[186.8,188],"en":"There are other choices."},{"t":[188.5,189.6],"en":"There's information that we need."},{"t":[189.6,191],"en":"Are you kidding me, Kevin?"},{"t":[191.5,192.6],"en":"After you almost killed me."},{"t":[193.1,194],"en":"Michael, I had you."},{"t":[194.6,195.9],"en":"I just want to try Phyllis."},{"t":[195.9,197.8],"en":"And if you want Michael as Santa, raise your hand."},{"t":[200.7,201.8],"en":"Can I get you some punch?"},{"t":[202,203.4],"en":"No, I'll get some punch."},{"t":[203.8,204.6],"en":"That was delicious."},{"t":[208.7,210.2],"en":"I don't ask for much for Christmas."},{"t":[210.4,211.1],"en":"I really don't."},{"t":[211.9,219.3],"en":"It's not like I am begging people to buy me diamonds and brooch pendants."},{"t":[220.1,223.3],"en":"Oh, buy me something expensive or I'm going to kill myself."},{"t":[223.4,224.6],"en":"That's not..."},{"t":[224.6,226.2],"en":"I don't care about that."},{"t":[226.5,227.6],"en":"All I want to be is Santa."},{"t":[228.7,232],"en":"And if you want to take that away from me, fine."},{"t":[232.6,233.4],"en":"Go ahead."},{"t":[234.3,238.3],"en":"But when you need my help, because I am ruining everything, don't look at me."},{"t":[239,242.2],"en":"Behold, Jesus Christ."},{"t":[242.9,247],"en":"And I bring to you glad Christmas tidings."},{"t":[247.1,250.1],"en":"I want to remind everyone the true meaning of Christmas."},{"t":[251.3,254.5],"en":"Those of you who wish to join me, that's great."},{"t":[254.6,255.8],"en":"I am excited by that."},{"t":[255.8,258.7],"en":"And those of you who don't, I forgive you."},{"t":[259.4,260.4],"en":"But I never forget."},{"t":[260.5,261.1],"en":"Wow, Michael."},{"t":[261.2,262.3],"en":"This must be obvious."},{"t":[262.3,263.1],"en":"How wrong this is."},{"t":[263.4,265.5],"en":"Oh, the Antichrist."},{"t":[265.8,266.7],"en":"Okay, you can't..."},{"t":[266.7,267],"en":"Ow."},{"t":[267.3,270.8],"en":"This just arrived from the Dunder Mithendorf Pole Branch."},{"t":[270.9,272.6],"en":"We don't have a North Pole Branch."},{"t":[273.1,273.7],"en":"Idiot."},{"t":[274.1,274.7],"en":"Uh-oh."},{"t":[274.8,276.1],"en":"What's Dwight going to get?"},{"t":[276.6,277.5],"en":"What is it?"},{"t":[279.2,279.7],"en":"Yes!"},{"t":[279.9,280.9],"en":"Oh, yes!"},{"t":[281,281.9],"en":"It's space garbage."},{"t":[282.5,284.7],"en":"Dwight's going to be able to build himself a friend."},{"t":[285.5,288.1],"en":"Dick hauls with crappy kids."},{"t":[288.1,289.1],"en":"And Stanley, hoo-hoo-hoo!"},{"t":[289.9,291.7],"en":"You've been very good this year."},{"t":[291.8,292.4],"en":"I have."},{"t":[292.8,294.6],"en":"Yeah, except for cheating on your wife."},{"t":[294.9,295.8],"en":"Adultery's a sin."},{"t":[296.1,297.2],"en":"Look it up in the Bible, people."},{"t":[297.7,298.1],"en":"What'd he get?"},{"t":[298.4,300.4],"en":"He got scented candles."},{"t":[300.6,301.9],"en":"Oh, well, that's appropriate."},{"t":[302.2,303.6],"en":"A lot of fire where you're going."},{"t":[303.9,304.8],"en":"Better get used to it."},{"t":[304.8,307.1],"en":"Walk a lonely road"},{"t":[307.1,310.6],"en":"Only one that I have ever known"},{"t":[310.6,313.1],"en":"Don't know where it goes"},{"t":[313.1,314.9],"en":"But it's all to me"},{"t":[314.9,316.4],"en":"And I walk alone"},{"t":[316.4,318],"en":"It's true."},{"t":[318.1,318.5],"en":"Yes!"},{"t":[319.1,320.2],"en":"We all walk alone."},{"t":[328.1,333.5],"en":"My shadow's the only one that walks beside me"},{"t":[333.5,334.5],"en":"Hi, Santa."},{"t":[335.1,336],"en":"Hi, Michael."},{"t":[339.7,340.2],"en":"Okay."},{"t":[342.7,343.9],"en":"I'd like to make a wish."},{"t":[344.8,345.3],"en":"What?"},{"t":[346.3,347.5],"en":"I would like an Xbox"},{"t":[347.5,351.6],"en":"and a TV that's compatible with an Xbox."},{"t":[354.5,355.7],"en":"And I'm sorry."},{"t":[359,360.7],"en":"An Xbox it is."},{"t":[361.1,363.3],"en":"Because I've decided you're a good boy."},{"t":[364.4,364.8],"en":"Scott."},{"t":[365.4,367.1],"en":"What in the hell is going on here?"},{"t":[367.3,367.6],"en":"No, no, no."},{"t":[367.7,368.2],"en":"We'll look it out."},{"t":[368.2,368.6],"en":"Did you call Bob?"},{"t":[368.8,369],"en":"Phyllis?"},{"t":[369,369.6],"en":"I'm sorry."},{"t":[369.7,370.5],"en":"I'm really sorry."},{"t":[370.6,371.6],"en":"It was earlier today."},{"t":[371.6,371.9],"en":"Okay."},{"t":[373.2,373.8],"en":"Hi, sweetheart."},{"t":[373.8,374.4],"en":"You're okay, baby."},{"t":[374.7,375.1],"en":"I'm a good baby."},{"t":[375.3,376.5],"en":"Oh, God."},{"t":[376.9,377.8],"en":"Get a room, Santas."},{"t":[377.8,397.9],"en":"Oh, God."}]}
